# nanopb static-allocation bounds for trace.proto.
#
# WatchRequest.watches decodes through a callback (no static array): the
# server streams entries into its own watch table, so a large list never
# rides in the Envelope union.
trace.WatchRequest.watches type:FT_CALLBACK
trace.Samples.data         max_size:256
trace.ReadReply.data       max_size:128
trace.WriteRequest.data    max_size:8
